### Style and tone
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"Dear team, please review the attached report."}

### Tone
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict/tone
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"Hey friend, thank you so much!"}

### Batch
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{"texts":["Hey friend, thank you so much!", "Please submit the report immediately."]}
